            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_c7000",
              "x": 208,
              "y": 28,
              "name": "窗口标题",
              "fill": "#E7B85B",
              "effect": {
                "type": "shadow",
                "shadowType": "outer",
                "color": "#1A120A99",
                "offset": {
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 2
                },
                "blur": 2
              },
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 300,
              "content": "EraWheel 魔王系统",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_c8000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 206,
              "name": "介绍标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "魔王系统是什么",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_c9000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 252,
              "name": "介绍正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "魔王系统负责魔王实体、技能行为、多魔王互动和据点配套。\n它像整轮战役的敌方核心，让世界从备战走向真正决战。\n玩家主要通过这里查看本轮魔王、互动关系、据点状态和降临压力。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_cb000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 404,
              "name": "流程标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "魔王什么时候出现",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_cc000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 450,
              "name": "流程正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "1. 预兆：系统先确定本轮魔王名单，并为每名魔王生成据点。\n2. 苏醒：将领先上场，魔王封印开始衰减。\n3. 降临：魔王封印归零后，魔王实体出现并主动进攻。\n4. 战后重建：本轮魔王状态、据点和互动关系被清理。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_ce000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 606,
              "name": "系统入口标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "多魔王互动做什么",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_cf000",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 652,
              "name": "系统入口正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "同轮存在多名魔王时，会进入联盟、内战或随机关系。\n联盟会强制停火并共享敌对目标，内战会互相宣战但仍攻击王国。\n内战胜者可以获得称号和限时属性加成。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
