              "name": "介绍标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "本轮魔王概览",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_c2h00",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 252,
              "name": "介绍正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "本轮名单：虚无之主、瘟疫母神。\n当前存活：2 / 2。\n互动模式：随机，当前关系为联盟。\n降临状态：魔王封印 42%，预计 42 年后归零。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_c2j00",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 406,
              "name": "流程标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "据点与战场",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_c2k00",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 452,
              "name": "流程正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "据点状态：2 个据点已生成，均绑定本轮魔王。\n生成位置：优先选择可行走陆地，并避开深水与拥挤地块。\n魔王、将领和军团会优先围绕对应据点出现。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_c2m00",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 581,
              "name": "系统入口标题",
              "fill": "#E5B960",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "胜利条件",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 28,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "br_enable_dmn_c2n00",
              "x": 88,
              "y": 627,
              "name": "系统入口正文",
              "fill": "#DDD4BB",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 576,
              "content": "胜利条件：最后一名存活魔王被击败。\n多魔王时，不会因为击败其中一名魔王就提前结算。\n结算后清理本轮魔王、据点、互动关系，并交回轮回系统推进下一轮。",
              "lineHeight": 1.22,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
